===Etymology 1===
{{root|nl|ine-pro|*weǵʰ-}}
From {{inh|nl|dum|gewichte}}. Compare {{cog|dum|wicht}}. Ultimately from {{der|nl|odt|wiht}}, from {{der|nl|gmw-pro|*wihti}}, from {{der|nl|gem-pro|*wihtiz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*gawihtiz}} (compare {{m|gem-pro|*weganą}}). Equivalent to {{affix|nl|ge-|wegen|t2=to weigh|-t|t3=verbal noun|id3=verbal noun}}.

